("treats object property order as irrelevant ⚠ verify exact matching rules in the \"Query Keys\" and \"Query Invalidation\" guides.","treats object property order as irrelevant (verified in 5.104: `hashKey(['a',{x:1,y:2}]) === hashKey(['a',{y:2,x:1}])`, array order *does* matter, a filter `['projects','list']` matches `['projects','list',{status:'a',page:1}]`, and an object inside a filter matches partially, so `{status:'a'}` matches `{status:'a',page:1}`; `exact: true` turns prefix matching off)."),
("(TanStack Query v5 style ⚠ verify)","(TanStack Query v5, executed against 5.104)"),
